    00826-투자변동사항-벤처캐피탈,기관투자가-INVST_CHG_TP_CD-cmb_VcInvstChgTpCd, cmb_InstInvstChgTpCd
    X-주식종류-벤처캐피탈,기관투자가-텍스트
    00123-발행구분-CB,BW,회사채-ISU_TP_CD-1:국내공모,2:국내사모,3:해외공모,4:해외사모,5:공모-cmb_IsuTpCd
    00835-행사구분-BW-EXER_PAY_TP_CD-1:채권대용납입,2:주금납입-cmb_ExerPayTpCd
    00945-대상자구분-보호예수-PRTDEPO_PRN_TP_CD-1:최대주주,2:특수관계인(영업양수시 비공개법인 포함),3:벤처금융,4:기관투자가,5:유상증자한도초과자-cmb_PrtdepoPrnTpCd
    01244-보호예수대상종류-보호예수-PRTDEPO_OBJ_KIND_CD-1:보통주,2:우선주,3:주식관련사채-cmb_PrtdepoObjKindCd
    00699-보호예수대상구분코드-보호예수-PRTDEPO_OBJ_TP_CD-1:전환우선주,2:상환우선주,3:상환전환우선주,4:전환사채,5:신주인수권부사채,6:기타-cmb_PrtdepoObjTpCd
     */
    const arrCid = [{
        cid: "PRELM_INVSTG_COM_TP_CD",
        cnm: "cmb_PrelmInvstgComTpCd"
    }, {
        cid: "AUDT_OPIN_TP_CD",
        cnm: "cmb_AudtOpin"
    }, {
        cid: "INVSTG_CLM_TP_CD",
        cnm: "cmb_InvstgClmTpCd"
    }, {
        cid: "CURR_ISO_CD",
        cnm: "cmb_CurrIsoCd"
    }, {
        cid: "VENT_DESIGN_RSN_CD",
        cnm: "cmb_VentDesignRsnCd"
    }, {
        cid: "TRANSSTK_AGNT_CD",
        cnm: "cmb_TransstkAgntCd"
    }, {
        cid: "INVST_CHG_TP_CD",
        cnm: "cmb_VcInvstChgTpCd"
    }, {
        cid: "INVST_CHG_TP_CD",
        cnm: "cmb_InstInvstChgTpCd"
    }, {
        cid: "ISU_TP_CD",
        cnm: "cmb_CbIsuTpCd"
    }, {
        cid: "ISU_TP_CD",
        cnm: "cmb_BwIsuTpCd"
    }, {
        cid: "ISU_TP_CD",
        cnm: "cmb_BndIsuTpCd"
    }, {
        cid: "EXER_PAY_TP_CD",
        cnm: "cmb_BwExerPayTpCd"
    }, {
        cid: "PRTDEPO_PRN_TP_CD",
        cnm: "cmb_PrtdepoPrnTpCd"
    }, {
        cid: "PRTDEPO_OBJ_KIND_CD",
        cnm: "cmb_PrtdepoObjKindCd"
    }, {
        cid: "PRTDEPO_OBJ_TP_CD",
        cnm: "cmb_PrtdepoObjTpCd"
    }];
    let objCod;
    const sbmOptions = {
        id : "sbm_dts_Cod",
        action : "/CodeAction.do",
        ref : "",
        target : "dts_Cod=body.content",
        isProcessMsg : false
